{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":6,"timestamp":1794172918,"nonce":"ZmGwN/GlGLUUeuK2DmrF4CvTAO4=","target":"88a32d757125dfe7862a7f1e0daf42863c061fb8e9571173341d686e502a6d27","message":"## Context\nCore view: every issue from every repo, filterable, and fast with thousands of issues. Sidebar `Section::Bugs` (`src/main.rs:12`) becomes `Issues`; the header's \"Add Filters\" (`src/ui/screen.rs:123` `content`) becomes a real filter bar.\n\n## Files\n- `src/filter.rs` — new, in lib: `Filter` + pure `matches(\u0026Issue, \u0026Filter)`\n- `src/ui/screen.rs` — Issues page, filter bar, rows\n- `src/main.rs:12` — rename the section\n\n## Approach\n- `Filter { kinds: set of Kind, status: Open | Closed | All (default Open), state: Any | InProgress | Blocked, repos, labels, text }`; text matches title and human id, case-insensitive (lowercased once at load, not per frame).\n- Filtered result is computed in `update` when the filter or data changes and stored as indices; `view` only renders it. Search input debounced ~150ms.\n- Rows rendered with `iced::widget::lazy` keyed on (repo, id, edit_time) so unchanged rows are not rebuilt.\n- Filter bar: kind chips, status segmented control, state, repo picker, search `text_input`; result count. Repos still loading show skeleton rows at the end of the list, not a blocked page.\n- Row: kind chip, title, `human_id`, repo name, state badge, labels via `components::chip` (`src/ui/components.rs:68`).\n- \"Open roadmap\" preset = `/roadmap-open` semantics (`../skillforge/plugins/roadmap/README.md`, Commands table): open only, in-progress/blocked first, children nested under their epic, ordered by layer.\n\n## Depends on\nL3 — loaded issues and load states in `App`\n\n## Out of scope\n- Detail pane (L6), actions (L7).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- `matches` unit tests cover each filter dimension and a combination\n- Unit test: the roadmap-open grouping puts in-progress/blocked first and nests children under their epic by layer\n- `view` does no filtering or sorting (review check)\n- All three gates pass","files":null}]}